  "findings": [
    "One new Android 1.0.46/build53 PDF Explain failure at 21:27:07.828 UTC, after its first Explain block took 39719ms. This is not a read-first-audio sample.",
    "A separate Read session on the same content began at 21:25:07.561 UTC, produced first audio in 1180ms, and later reached 600 playback seconds. This is not evidence of Explain recovery.",
    "Frozen source 3fe41d62 confirms exitExplainToRead does not cancel the Explain Job or end its analytics session. Late generic failures lack mode/session/generation guards and can update Explain statistics and shared UI after Read starts.",
    "That generic failure branch does not pause or clear the Read player. There is no proven fixed 120-second timer, original exception or exact client-to-server request join for this incident. Keep the failure; do not reclassify as cancellation or false positive.",
    "22 new GET blog-page functions hit the 300-second Vercel limit. They are not TTS/clone/QuickRead API504, and their latest estimated end precedes the observed PDF Explain start. Internal awaited operation is unknown.",
    "US QuickRead fixed-tag log scan at 21:23–21:29 has no matched error tag, but cannot establish successful network/model work or identify the mobile request.",
    "One new Direct no-response entry exactly matches a proxy cancellation. It is Android1.0.45 and is not correlated to the Android1.0.46 Explain failure."
  ],
